## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database Schema & Triggers

#### [MODIFY] [database/schema.sql](file:///d:/Shahzaad/Projects/College/classroomUtilOpSystem/database/schema.sql)
- Add `created_by INT NULL, FOREIGN KEY (created_by) REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE SET NULL` and `updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP` to `Course_Schedule`.
- Add `trg_check_schedule_update` (`BEFORE UPDATE ON Course_Schedule`): checks room/batch slot conflicts (excluding current `schedule_id`) and capacity constraint.
- Add `trg_check_room_capacity_update` (`BEFORE UPDATE ON Room`): signals error if `NEW.capacity < (SELECT MAX(b.student_count) FROM Course_Schedule cs JOIN Batch b ON cs.batch_id = b.batch_id WHERE cs.room_number = NEW.room_number)`.
- Add `trg_check_batch_size_update` (`BEFORE UPDATE ON Batch`): signals error if `NEW.student_count > (SELECT MIN(r.capacity) FROM Course_Schedule cs JOIN Room r ON cs.room_number = r.room_number WHERE cs.batch_id = NEW.batch_id)`.

#### [MODIFY] [database/seed.sql](file:///d:/Shahzaad/Projects/College/classroomUtilOpSystem/database/seed.sql)
- Populate `created_by` with the seed coordinator ID for initial schedules.

